# Ignore everything in this directory
*

# Except .gitignore and dotenv file
!.gitignore
!.env
!.env.secrets.example

# Secret files consumed via compose `secrets:`. Real values stay ignored
# by the blanket `*` above; only the .example templates are committed.
!secrets/
secrets/*
!secrets/*.example

# Bazarr's config tree is live state and stays ignored: config.yaml holds its
# real API key, the Sonarr/Radarr keys, subtitle-provider logins and session
# cookies, and config/db/bazarr.db holds the subtitle history. Only the
# sanitized seed is committed; `make bootstrap` copies it into place.
!config/
config/*
!config/config/
config/config/*
!config/config/config.yaml.example
!config/
